    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39966" root="نضح" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزَادَةٌ نَضُوحٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مزادة</span> <i>that sweats,</i> or <i>exudes its
water.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَضُوحٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A certain kind of
perfume.</i> (S, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَضْحٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْسٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَضُوحٌ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُضَحِيَّةٌ</span></b> , <i>A bow that impels the
arrow with force,</i> or <i>sends it far, and that
scatters the arrows much;</i> expl. by ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرُوحٌ نَضَّاحَةٌ</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلنَّبْلِ</span>. (AHn, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">النَّضُوحُ</span> One of the
names of <i>The bow.</i> (TA.)

